{title: O Vos Omnes}
{subtitle: Lamentations 1:12}
{key: D#m}
{tempo: 75}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D#m]O vos omnes qui transitis per viam
attendite et videte
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Si est dolor [B]sicut dolor [C#]meus
[D#m]si est dolor sicut dolor meus
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[B]O vos omnes [C#]qui transitis per viam
[B]attendite [C#]et videte
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[D#m]Si est dolor sicut dolor meus
{end_of_verse}
